#: lib/game/utils/event_manager.dart:
msgid "Where am I? How did I end up here?"
msgstr "我在哪儿？我怎么会在这儿？"

#: lib/game/utils/event_manager.dart:
msgid "Mitsu Forest used to be bigger, it was deforested to build Greentwig City."
msgstr "迷津森林过去还更大一些，它是因郁枝市的兴建而被砍伐了。"

#: lib/game/utils/event_manager.dart:
msgid "The Xeonjia Tower is the tallest building in the Kingdom."
msgstr "Xeonjia塔楼是国境之中最高的建筑。"

#: lib/game/utils/event_manager.dart:
msgid "There are 3 regions in the Kingdom."
msgstr "国境之中一共有三个王国。"

#: lib/game/utils/event_manager.dart:
msgid "If you click on a point on the world map you can travel to places you have already been."
msgstr "如果你点击王国地图上的一个点你可以重游至你已经去到过的地方。"

#: lib/game/utils/event_manager.dart:
msgid "The world is big."
msgstr "世界大着呢。"

#: lib/game/utils/event_manager.dart:
msgid "What time is it?"
msgstr "现在啥时候了？"

#: lib/game/utils/event_manager.dart:
msgid "If we walk around long enough, we're sure to arrive somewhere!"
msgstr "如果我们四处逛得足够远，我们一定会去到点什么地方的！"

#: lib/game/utils/event_manager.dart:
msgid "How are you?"
msgstr "你好？"

#: lib/game/utils/event_manager.dart:
msgid "It's cold here."
msgstr "这儿好冷啊。"

#: lib/game/utils/event_manager.dart:
msgid "Green! Green!\nGreen is the answer, but I don't remember the question."
msgstr "绿色！是绿色！\n答案是绿色，但是我不记得问题了。"

#: lib/game/utils/event_manager.dart:
msgid "Ours is a strange world, it's cold here but a little warmer there."
msgstr "我们王国真是奇怪，这儿冷，那儿却又暖和点儿。"

#: lib/game/utils/event_manager.dart:
msgid "I have to stop eating ice cream before bed."
msgstr "我真不能再在睡前吃冰淇淋了。"

#: lib/game/utils/event_manager.dart:
msgid "I know many languages."
msgstr "我会很多种语言哦。"

#: lib/game/utils/event_manager.dart:
msgid "Hey!"
msgstr "嘿！"

#: lib/game/utils/event_manager.dart:
msgid "Here I am."
msgstr "我在呢。"

#: lib/game/utils/event_manager.dart:
msgid "Leave me alone."
msgstr "让我一个人待一会儿。"

#: lib/game/utils/event_manager.dart:
msgid "Do you believe in fairies??"
msgstr "你相信有仙子吗？"

#: lib/game/utils/event_manager.dart:
msgid "What do piglets dream about?"
msgstr "小猪们会做些什么梦呢？"

#: lib/game/utils/event_manager.dart:
msgid "I am hungryyy."
msgstr "我好饿呃饿饿啊。"

#: lib/game/utils/event_manager.dart:
msgid "And that's it.\nWe have now reached the end of this fantastic adventure!\nYour determination and courage made this victory possible.\nKeep exploring, dreaming and being the hero the world needs, because your adventures will never end.\nWhere will your next journey take you?\nThank you for playing Xeonjia!\nMaybe our paths will cross again."
msgstr "这就是全部了。\n我们现在来到了这趟绮旅的结尾！\n你的决心与勇气成就了这场胜利。\n继续探索，想象和成为世界需要的那个勇者，因为你的冒险永无止境。\n你的下一趟旅程可又将你何向？\n感谢你游玩Xeonjia！\n或许我们将在某处重逢。"

#: lib/game/utils/event_manager.dart:
msgid "Bye!"
msgstr "拜！"

