msgstr "米拉累了，她回到叶子里休息了，但我必须继续战斗。"

#: lib/game/xeonjia_game.dart:
msgid "September is tired, I must continue the battle alone."
msgstr "九月累了，但我必须独自战斗。"

#: lib/game/xeonjia_game.dart:
msgid "September is tired, but we must continue the battle."
msgstr "九月累了，但我们必须继续战斗。"

#: lib/game/xeonjia_game.dart:
msgid "Battle!"
msgstr "开战!"

#: lib/game/xeonjia_game.dart:
